  "prompt": "For each month of 2025, compare like-for-like net revenue with the same month of 2024. Like for like means only stores open for the whole of both years: stores that opened on or before 1 January 2024 and have no close_date (the webshop counts as a store). Order dates are UTC days. Return four columns, in this order: month (the first day of the 2025 month), revenue_eur, revenue_prev_year_eur and growth_pct, the change as a percentage of the 2024 revenue (12.5 for 12.5%), rounded to 1 decimal. When those stores had no orders in the same month of 2024, show revenue_prev_year_eur and growth_pct as missing. Return one row for each month of 2025 with like-for-like sales. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "month",
        "type_class": "temporal"
      },
      {
        "name": "revenue_eur",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "revenue_prev_year_eur",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
      {
        "name": "growth_pct",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
    ],
    "grain": null
  },
